      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;dragonlordged&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"dragonlordged\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On a similar note, I believe the Self Destruct Procedure card also from Mars has you setting aside cards (not drawing them). Am I correct in the assumption that the trash pile is shuffled if you need to set aside a card from it as well, or can the heroes just get killed by the Self Destruct being the last card of the deck?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Same thing as the drawing in this case.  If you need to set aside a card, but the deck is depleted, just shuffle the Environment Trash and make it the Environment Deck.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:56:44.773Z",
