      "id": 22719,
      "name": "Christopher",
      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-20T15:04:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Specifically, the “Draw” phase of a Hero turn is optional, in that it reads “You <span class=\"bbcode-b\">may</span> draw a card”.  Whenever a card says “You may draw a card” it means just that.  Whenever a card says “Draw a card” then you must comply.</p>",
