    {
      "id": 22721,
      "name": "arenson9",
      "username": "arenson9",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-11-18T06:13:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Christopher&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Christopher\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"WriterRyan\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/48/2710_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> WriterRyan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Because it would affect things like the toxic damage environment card, decks don’t get reshuffled until a draw is required.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Is this the official ruling?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Add to the official rulings?</p>",
